    "title": "NATO divided on how to respond to repeated Russian incursions - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natasha Bertrand Kylie Atwood ,\n21 minutes ago NATO allies are divided over whether the alliance should make it a policy to shoot down Russian jets that violate NATO’s airspace, with some countries including the US, Poland, and Baltic nations signaling that future violations should be met with force, while others, including Germany, urge more restraint. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
